# Workflow 10: Metrics Calculation

## Goal

Automatically calculate participation metrics.

---

## Trigger Events

Metrics are recalculated when:

```text
Transcript Generated
Transcript Edited
Submission Saved
Submission Submitted
```

---

## Word Count

Formula:

```text
Count all words in transcript.
```

Example:

```text
Hello everyone.
Today I will discuss travel.
```

Result:

```text
6 words
```

---

## Turn Count

Formula:

```text
Count all non-empty lines.
```

Example:

```text
Hello everyone.
Today I will discuss travel.
```

Result:

```text
2 turns
```

---

## Average Words Per Turn

Formula:

```text
Word Count / Turn Count
```

Example:

```text
6 words
2 turns
```

Result:

```text
3.00
```

