# Submission Status Lifecycle

Every submission must have one status.

```text
Draft
↓
Processing
↓
Ready For Review
↓
Submitted
↓
Graded
```

---

## Draft

Student has started work.

---

## Processing

Transcript generation running.

---

## Ready For Review

Transcript available.

---

## Submitted

Student has submitted final work.

---

## Graded

Teacher has completed assessment.

